    屡 | lǚ | repeatedly; time and again | Has 米 inside 尸 instead of 禹
    屑 | xiè | scrap; crumb; trivial | Has 肖 inside 尸 instead of 禹
    尾 | wěi | tail; rear | Has 毛 inside 尸 instead of 禹
  etymological_cognates[5]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
