    嘱 | zhǔ | urge; enjoin; entrust
    瞩 | zhǔ | gaze intently; focus eyes on

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 金属 is the scientific and material umbrella term for all lustrous, conductive metallic substances.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 金属 vs. 铁 | tiě | 金属 is the overarching chemical class (including copper, aluminum, gold, silver), whereas 铁 is specifically the single element iron (Fe).
    2 | 金属 vs. 黄金 | huángjīn | 金属 encompasses all elemental metals, while 黄金 refers specifically to the precious element gold (Au).
    3 | 金属 vs. 塑料 | sùliào | 金属 is dense, conductive, and mined from ore, while 塑料 is a synthetic organic polymer petroleum product.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 青铜器上的斑驳锈迹，记录着三千年前工匠淬炼金属的非凡智慧。从烈火中熔铸而出的鼎彝盘簋，铭刻着华夏文明最初的礼乐制度。沉稳厚重的金属光芒，穿越漫长的岁月长河，依然散发着令人肃然起敬的历史威严。 | Qīngtóngqì shàng de bānbó xiùjì, jìlù zhe sānqiān nián qián gōngjiàng cuìliàn jīnshǔ de fēifán zhìhuì. Cóng lièhuǒ zhōng róngzhù-érchū de dǐng-yí-pán-guǐ, míngkè zhe Huáxià wénmíng zuìchū de lǐyuè zhìdù. Chénwěn hòuzhòng de jīnshǔ guāngmáng, chuānyuè màncháng de suìyuè chánghé, yīrán sànfà zhe lìngrén sùrán-qǐjìng de lìshǐ wēiyán. | Mottled patinas on bronzes record artisans' wisdom smelting metal three millennia ago. Ritual cauldrons forged in roaring fire inscribed Cathayan rites and music. This metallic sheen crosses millennia, radiating history's awe-inspiring majesty. | La pátina de los bronces atestigua el ingenio de los artífices que templaban el metal hace tres milenios. Los calderos rituales forjados al fuego grabaron la armonía de la civilización china; su noble brillo metálico impone respeto a través de los siglos.
  #2 | 在现代高端制造业与绿色新能源领域，高纯度稀有金属是制造芯片传感器与动力电池不可或缺的战略基石。加强特种金属资源的科学开采与循环回收利用，对于保障国家产业链供应链安全具有不可替代的战略价值。 | Zài xiàndài gāoduān zhìzàoyè yǔ lǜsè xīnnéngyuán lǐngyù, gāochúndù xīyǒu jīnshǔ shì zhìzào xīnpiàn chuángǎnqì yǔ dònglì diànchí bùkě-huòquē de zhànlüè jīshí. Jiāqiáng tèzhǒng jīnshǔ zīyuán de kēxué kāicǎi yǔ xúnhuán huíshōu lìyòng, duìyú bǎozhàng guójiā chǎnyèliàn gōngyìngliàn ānquán jùyǒu bùkě-tìdài de zhànlüè jiàzhí. | In advanced manufacturing and renewables, high-purity rare metals are strategic pillars for semiconductor chips and batteries. Bolstering scientific mining and recycling of specialty metals safeguards national industrial supply chains. | En la industria de vanguardia y las energías renovables, los metales raros son pilares estratégicos para fabricar chips y baterías. Reforzar la extracción científica y el reciclaje de estos metales asegura la soberanía de las cadenas de suministro.
